OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACoach kept thousands of indecent
OL,4,Aimages of boys
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 26-year-old, who was arrested in
OL,7,FSapley, Huntingdon, but moved to
OL,8,FPreston, initially denied any knowledge
OL,9,Fof the images, but on the day of his
OL,10,Ftrial pleaded guilty to three counts of
OL,11,Fmaking indecent images of children and
OL,12,Fone count of distributing an indecent
OL,13,Fimage or video.
OL,15,FStrachan was sentenced to three years
OL,16,Fand four months in prison at Cambridge
OL,17,FCrown Court on Friday.
